{
  "name": "Totem Hackathon - LOYVERSE - Canje (v1)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🧾 Canje de cupón vía Loyverse\nCuando el cajero cobra en Loyverse identificando al cliente por teléfono y aplicando el descuento \"Tótem\", Loyverse dispara el webhook `receipts.update`.\n\nEste flujo:\n1. Verifica la firma (header `X-Loyverse-Signature`, HMAC-SHA256 con el secreto del webhook)\n2. Revisa si el recibo trae el descuento configurado\n3. Marca el cupón `activo` más reciente de ese cliente como `canjeado`\n\n⚠️ Configura DISCOUNT_TOTEM_ID abajo con el ID real del descuento (Loyverse → Items → Discounts).\n⚠️ Verifica el nombre exacto de los campos del payload la primera vez que llegue un recibo real: la firma de arriba es la documentada, pero conviene confirmarla contra un envío real antes de confiar en producción.\n⚠️ Si tu n8n corre en modo \"Function\" restringido, habilita NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto en el entorno para que el nodo de verificación de firma funcione.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -960,
        -400
      ],
      "id": "36e002c1-d991-4b8d-887c-0cc04990ac96",
      "name": "🧾 Nota"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "totem-loyverse-receipts",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -960,
        80
      ],
      "id": "c7646a3f-c517-458b-b902-0e5e0cdfea0d",
      "name": "Loyverse Webhook — Recibos",
      "webhookId": "totem-loyverse-v1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// ── Verifica la firma del webhook de Loyverse ───────────────────\n// Requiere NODE_FUNCTION_ALLOW_BUILTIN=crypto en el entorno de n8n.\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\n\nconst secret = $env.LOYVERSE_WEBHOOK_SECRET || '';\nconst signatureHeader = $json.headers?.['x-loyverse-signature'] || '';\nconst rawBody = JSON.stringify($json.body || {});\n\nconst firmaCalculada = crypto\n  .createHmac('sha256', secret)\n  .update(rawBody)\n  .digest('hex');\n\nconst firmaValida = secret ? signatureHeader === firmaCalculada : true; // sin secreto configurado, no bloquea (solo para pruebas)\n\nconst receipt = $json.body?.receipts?.[0] || $json.body || {};\n\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    firmaValida,\n    receiptNumber: receipt.receipt_number || null,\n    customerId: receipt.customer_id || null,\n    lineDiscounts: receipt.line_items?.flatMap(li => li.line_discounts || []) || [],\n    totalDiscounts: receipt.total_discounts || [],\n  },\n};"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -736,
        80
      ],
      "id": "57f3a404-2a92-4336-8051-50c0d72d7b21",
      "name": "Verificar Firma y Extraer Recibo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.firmaValida }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "id": "firma-ok"
            },
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ [...$json.lineDiscounts, ...$json.totalDiscounts].some(d => d.id === $vars.DISCOUNT_TOTEM_ID || d.discount_id === $vars.DISCOUNT_TOTEM_ID) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "id": "trae-descuento-totem"
            },
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.customerId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              },
              "id": "tiene-cliente"
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -512,
        80
      ],
      "id": "95dd50f1-80a0-4abf-822c-f8879c6a4b62",
      "name": "¿Recibo con descuento Tótem?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "select * from marcar_cupon_canjeado_por_loyverse($1, $2);",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [$json.customerId, $json.receiptNumber] }}"
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.5,
      "position": [
        -288,
        0
      ],
      "id": "58160e21-f38f-428e-8c98-3e59ec4562e8",
      "name": "Marcar Cupón Canjeado",
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR_ID",
